    "title": "Naväge Advanced Nose Cleaner",
    "body_html": "<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\">Outsmart congestion with a</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\">n electronically controlled<span> </span></span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\">pressure sensor<span> </span></span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\">and<span> </span></span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\">three comfort settings to customize the power of your rinse, flushing out allergens, germs, mucus, and over 99% of viruses¹</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\">.</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\"><span> </span>Designed with a board-certified ENT, the Naväge Advanced Nose Cleaner uses powered suction to wash and moisturize the nasal cavity with a pressure-controlled stream of saline.<span> </span></span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\">It’s</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\"><span> </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\">USB-C rechargeable with<span> </span></span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\">a<span> </span></span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\">Clean-Assist Mode and a Premium Air-Dry Mat</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\"><span> </span>for</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\"><span> </span>easy maintenance and<span> </span></span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\">hygienic</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\"><span> </span></span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\">drying.</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW10650465 BCX0\"> </span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW10650465 BCX0\"> </span></p>\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW256023997 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW256023997 BCX0\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW256023997 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW256023997 BCX0\">WHAT'S IN THE BOX</span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW256023997 BCX0\"> </span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW256023997 BCX0\">\n<ul class=\"BulletListStyle1 SCXW256023997 BCX0\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW256023997 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW256023997 BCX0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW256023997 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW256023997 BCX0\">Naväge Advanced Nose Cleaner, Model SDG-2.5</span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW256023997 BCX0\"> </span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW256023997 BCX0\">\n<ul class=\"BulletListStyle1 SCXW256023997 BCX0\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW256023997 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW256023997 BCX0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW256023997 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW256023997 BCX0\">20 Naväge<span> </span></span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW256023997 BCX0\">SaltPod</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW256023997 BCX0\"><span> </span>capsules (Original Sea Salt)</span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW256023997 BCX0\"> </span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW256023997 BCX0\">\n<ul class=\"BulletListStyle1 SCXW256023997 BCX0\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW256023997 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW256023997 BCX0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW256023997 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW256023997 BCX0\">Premium Air-Dry Mat</span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
